        <mxCell id="finding3-box" value="FINDING 3: Block 3 Dominance&#xa;&#xa;Block 3: 95% of decision-making&#xa;Blocks 0-2: &lt;1% combined&#xa;&#xa;Why: Gradient flow dynamics&#xa;- Block 3: Direct gradients (1 hop)&#xa;- Block 0: 4th-order gradients (4 hops)&#xa;- Residual saturation after 3 iterations&#xa;- Blocks 1-2: Overfitting/redundant" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top" vertex="1" parent="1">
