        <mxCell id="finding4-box" value="FINDING 4: Dual Feature Hierarchies&#xa;&#xa;Attention Probes (tracking quality):&#xa;• Block 0: 65% → Block 4: 43% (DEGRADES)&#xa;• Output context: 62.5% (recovered)&#xa;&#xa;Auditory Probes (envelope amplitude):&#xa;• Block 0: 23% → Block 3: 45% (BUILDS)&#xa;• Output context: 35% (abstracted)&#xa;&#xa;Why: Disentangled representations&#xa;- Middle layers: &quot;What&quot; (stimulus features)&#xa;- Input/Output: &quot;Which&quot; (attention state)&#xa;- Mirrors ventral/dorsal cortical streams" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top" vertex="1" parent="1">
