        <mxCell id="summary-box" value="KEY INSIGHTS FOR BCI DESIGN&#xa;&#xa;1. Focus on parietal channels (42, 50, 43) → 2× gain&#xa;2. Optimize for first 1-2 seconds → 3× efficiency&#xa;3. Simplify to Block 3 only → 95% performance retained&#xa;4. Monitor correct vs incorrect patterns → trust calibration&#xa;5. Use alpha/theta bands → task-relevant frequencies&#xa;&#xa;Validation: All attributions pass sanity checks ✓&#xa;Alignment: Matches neuroscience literature ✓&#xa;Transparency: White-box BCI for clinical use ✓" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="1060" width="460" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
